"Perte comptable sur la disposition d'immobilisations annulée (ligne 111)"

#. module: l10n_ca_corporate_tax_cca
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ca_corporate_tax_cca/models/l10n_ca_corporate_tax_estimate.py:0
msgid "Capital cost allowance claimed (line 403)"
msgstr "Déduction pour amortissement demandée (ligne 403)"

#. module: l10n_ca_corporate_tax_cca
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_ca_corporate_tax_cca.model_l10n_ca_corporate_tax_estimate
msgid "Corporate Income Tax Estimate"
msgstr "Estimation de l'impôt sur le revenu des sociétés"

#. module: l10n_ca_corporate_tax_cca
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ca_corporate_tax_cca/models/l10n_ca_corporate_tax_estimate.py:0
msgid ""
"No federal CCA schedule ends on %(date)s: the capital cost allowance is not "
"loaded from the assets."
msgstr ""
"Aucune annexe fédérale de DPA ne se termine le %(date)s : la déduction pour "
"amortissement n'est pas chargée à partir des immobilisations."

#. module: l10n_ca_corporate_tax_cca
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ca_corporate_tax_cca/models/l10n_ca_corporate_tax_estimate.py:0
msgid "Recapture of capital cost allowance (line 107)"
msgstr "Récupération de l'amortissement (ligne 107)"

#. module: l10n_ca_corporate_tax_cca
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ca_corporate_tax_cca/models/l10n_ca_corporate_tax_estimate.py:0
msgid "Terminal loss (line 404)"
msgstr "Perte finale (ligne 404)"

#. module: l10n_ca_corporate_tax_cca
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ca_corporate_tax_cca/models/l10n_ca_corporate_tax_estimate.py:0
msgid ""
"The CCA lines loaded (%(loaded)s) differ from %(schedule)s (%(expected)s): "
"click Load from Accounting again."
msgstr ""
"Les lignes de DPA chargées (%(loaded)s) diffèrent de %(schedule)s "
"(%(expected)s) : cliquez de nouveau sur Charger depuis la comptabilité."

#. module: l10n_ca_corporate_tax_cca
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ca_corporate_tax_cca/models/l10n_ca_corporate_tax_estimate.py:0
msgid ""
"The Quebec CCA schedule gives a Quebec taxable income %(difference)s "
"different from the federal one (positive: higher). The estimate computes "
"both taxes on the federal taxable income, so the Quebec tax is estimated on "
"that difference too."
msgstr ""
"L'annexe de DPA du Québec donne un revenu imposable du Québec différent du "
"revenu fédéral de %(difference)s (positif : plus élevé). L'estimation "
"calcule les deux impôts sur le revenu imposable fédéral; l'impôt du Québec "
"est donc aussi estimé sur cet écart."
